0 //A skirt or other hipwear goes onto a minifigure's hips, their studs passing through its holes (open at both ends,
0 //so any stud fits), and the torso goes on top: what is left of each hip stud above the hipwear (11 LDU less its 3),
0 //which the torso's holes take as they take the hips' own.
